WEBVTT

00:01.010 --> 00:04.140
Emilia, are you a virgin?

00:04.140 --> 00:06.980
That's the one thing that really matters.

00:10.780 --> 00:15.450
I'm sorry. Asking that out of the 
blue must have bewildered you.

00:15.450 --> 00:17.200
I sincerely apologize.

00:18.310 --> 00:22.460
I'm not like those low-lifes who 
can't own up to their own mistakes.

00:23.400 --> 00:26.420
Well, it's important to be 
able to apologize sincerely.

00:26.420 --> 00:29.440
There are far too many people in this world

00:29.440 --> 00:31.860
who don't understand what 
should be so obvious.

00:32.500 --> 00:35.260
You truly are a magnificent woman.

00:35.990 --> 00:38.560
Now, allow me to ask once more.

00:38.560 --> 00:41.470
Emilia, are you a virgin?

00:42.910 --> 00:44.290
Well, are you?

00:45.030 --> 00:47.690
Um... What is a "virgin"?

00:47.690 --> 00:50.190
I'm sorry. I've never heard the term before.

00:50.470 --> 00:52.320
Magnificent!

00:52.320 --> 00:55.780
You are the very picture of my ideal woman!

00:56.120 --> 00:58.950
It's clear that you have a virgin body.

00:58.950 --> 01:03.310
What truly matters is whether 
you have a virgin soul, as well.

01:03.310 --> 01:06.540
You have shown me a new way of thinking!

01:06.540 --> 01:07.710
I have?

01:08.000 --> 01:09.450
Of course.

01:10.240 --> 01:12.670
Oh, dear. I haven't introduced myself yet.

01:13.160 --> 01:15.620
My name is Regulus Corneas.

01:15.620 --> 01:17.920
I'm your dear husband,

01:17.920 --> 01:21.100
and you are my beloved 79th wife.

01:21.400 --> 01:22.140
Huh?

01:22.510 --> 01:24.380
I have a change of clothes for you.

01:29.390 --> 01:33.330
Number 184, change Number 79's clothes.

01:33.330 --> 01:35.700
She will hold the same 
role as the rest of you.

01:35.700 --> 01:38.090
Take good care of her.

01:39.330 --> 01:40.630
Good girl.

01:40.630 --> 01:42.950
You've stopped smiling, 
just like I told you to.

01:48.250 --> 01:50.630
Well, I'll see you later.

01:51.250 --> 01:52.010
All right...

01:57.850 --> 01:58.970
Let us change your clothes.

01:58.970 --> 02:00.380
Who are you?

02:00.380 --> 02:02.270
I'm Number 184.

02:02.270 --> 02:04.560
I'm his wife, just like you.

02:04.560 --> 02:08.940
I don't recall becoming his wife...

02:08.940 --> 02:10.880
But in his mind, you are.

02:10.880 --> 02:13.350
And the fact that he's 
decided you're his wife

02:13.350 --> 02:16.050
means that how you feel is irrelevant.

02:16.050 --> 02:16.610
Huh?

02:16.610 --> 02:18.600
But that doesn't make sense!

02:20.240 --> 02:23.990
He reminds me of an evil 
king I once saw in a book.

02:25.260 --> 02:26.660
A fitting description.

02:26.660 --> 02:27.370
Huh?

02:27.880 --> 02:30.770
He is indeed a king in his own right.

02:30.770 --> 02:33.340
Certainly worthy of the title "Little King."

02:36.060 --> 02:37.230
Let us change your clothes.

02:40.390 --> 02:42.010
Subaru...

04:14.190 --> 04:16.270
Gluttony!

04:25.990 --> 04:28.450
Remember your goal here, little girl user!

04:30.620 --> 04:34.080
If you come up against Gluttony, 
don't tell him your real name.

04:34.080 --> 04:36.480
What was our purpose in coming here?

04:36.480 --> 04:40.360
Hey, hey, hey! You really 
want to just run away?

04:40.360 --> 04:43.920
Don't you have a bone to pick with me, bro?

04:45.130 --> 04:50.390
There is no meal more satisfying 
than an opponent ordained by fate.

04:50.390 --> 04:55.310
Just let yourself be eaten 
and drunk to excess!

04:58.480 --> 05:01.980
Sorry. Rem. Hang in there a little longer.

05:01.980 --> 05:02.480
Move!

05:02.480 --> 05:04.100
Look after the Valkyrie!

05:04.100 --> 05:06.160
Don't you dare lose, Juli!

05:08.000 --> 05:10.920
P-Please don't let go!

05:18.290 --> 05:19.880
Is this a metia, too?

05:19.880 --> 05:21.680
Subaru-sama!

05:26.560 --> 05:27.220
Look!

05:27.840 --> 05:29.180
A hostage!

05:30.680 --> 05:32.310
I don't think so!

05:36.600 --> 05:37.850
Gotcha!

05:39.190 --> 05:40.770
It's over!

05:48.810 --> 05:50.370
I'll keep an eye on the area.

05:50.370 --> 05:52.080
You take the child.

05:52.080 --> 05:54.790
O-Okay... Got it.

05:57.370 --> 06:01.590
Don't worry. This nice lady 
took care of that scary dragon.

06:03.120 --> 06:06.050
Do you know where all the other people are?

06:06.050 --> 06:08.300
I-In that room.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.750
The hell... is this?

06:39.510 --> 06:41.020
Subaru-sa—

06:41.020 --> 06:42.540
Crusch-san?!

06:45.560 --> 06:48.260
Why are you guys such simpletons?!

06:48.260 --> 06:49.630
You're...

06:49.630 --> 06:54.390
Did you think I was a brave, 
fragile little hostage girl?

06:57.060 --> 06:58.820
Ta-da!

07:00.230 --> 07:02.020
Move your leg.

07:02.340 --> 07:03.510
Huh?

07:03.510 --> 07:08.760
Are you infatuated with 
my beautiful legs now...

07:08.760 --> 07:11.320
or just with this female meat?

07:14.210 --> 07:17.290
She does have such an erotic figure,
doesn't she?

07:17.710 --> 07:22.610
I'm saying she's not someone you're 
worthy of holding under your foot!

07:22.610 --> 07:23.850
This better hit!

07:23.850 --> 07:24.500
Fine.

07:40.840 --> 07:43.030
What kind of face is that?

07:43.030 --> 07:46.520
Has my beauty rendered you speechless?

07:46.520 --> 07:48.480
What... is that?

07:48.930 --> 07:52.950
What the hell does it look like 
to you, little meat scrap?

07:52.950 --> 07:56.950
You're not... a dragon that 
takes on human form, are you?

07:56.950 --> 08:02.770
And there it is! The irrationality 
that shows what a moron you are!

08:20.340 --> 08:22.630
You... transformed?

08:25.680 --> 08:30.480
I'm the Sin Archbishop in the 
Witch's Cult representing lust,

08:30.480 --> 08:33.430
Capella Emerada Lugunica.

08:33.430 --> 08:38.660
I'll transform into the kind 
of girl you like, just for you.

08:45.230 --> 08:47.900
I'm sure even a meat scrap 
like you understands by now

08:47.900 --> 08:50.040
what the lizard passed out over there

08:50.040 --> 08:52.970
and those flies in the other 
room really are, right?

08:52.970 --> 08:56.640
Wait... Wait, wait, wait, wait!

08:56.640 --> 09:00.150
Those were all people who 
were in here, and you...

09:00.150 --> 09:04.450
Correct! But it took you too long,
so you don't get a prize!

09:05.600 --> 09:11.040
I can't understand this! How... 
How could you do that?!

09:11.040 --> 09:14.110
Turning people into flies?
What's the point?!

09:14.110 --> 09:15.610
You find it disgusting?

09:15.610 --> 09:19.090
It's blood-curdling! You... All of you are...

09:19.090 --> 09:20.080
That's right.

09:20.080 --> 09:23.250
It's so disgusting and repulsive, 
it makes you hate me.

09:23.250 --> 09:25.430
That's just it!

09:25.430 --> 09:28.400
Seeing that made you hate 
me on a visceral level.

09:28.400 --> 09:29.750
That's the right answer.

09:29.750 --> 09:33.380
No one could love creatures like those!

09:34.150 --> 09:36.090
Just go ahead and kill me.

09:36.090 --> 09:37.940
What? Why?

09:37.940 --> 09:42.260
I'm a philanthropist. I'd never 
do something so barbaric.

09:42.260 --> 09:47.190
I want as many as possible, for as long 
as possible, as deeply as possible...

09:47.190 --> 09:48.690
to love me!

09:50.530 --> 09:56.150
Get it? Because that... is... my... wish.

10:01.430 --> 10:02.280
Crusch-san!

10:02.280 --> 10:08.080
See? You always end up drooling over that 
female meat because you want her so bad!

10:08.080 --> 10:10.220
Quit running your mouth!

10:10.220 --> 10:11.840
There's someone else I—

10:11.840 --> 10:13.550
Oh, shut it!

10:13.550 --> 10:19.300
Can you swear that you haven't had 
lewd thoughts for a single second?!

10:19.300 --> 10:21.930
Don't you just want to stroke her hair?

10:21.930 --> 10:24.950
Aren't you just in love with those lips?

10:24.950 --> 10:27.730
Don't you dare take that carnal desire

10:27.730 --> 10:32.160
that you can't even speak of in the 
open and dress it up as "love"!

10:35.320 --> 10:38.490
Think you'll say that shit 
again even after seeing this?

10:40.480 --> 10:44.660
That same obligatory, requisite objection?

10:47.000 --> 10:52.080
"I love her because I was 
drawn to her good heart."

10:52.410 --> 10:55.330
"Because she's the only 
one who saw me for me."

10:55.330 --> 10:57.750
"Because she stayed by my 
side when times were tough."

10:57.750 --> 11:01.550
"Because I can be my true 
self when I'm with her."

11:01.960 --> 11:06.010
"Because when I'm with you, 
everything looks more colorful."

11:06.650 --> 11:08.850
"Because I can't go on alone anymore."

11:09.670 --> 11:11.690
"Because, though my life's been full of lies,

11:12.310 --> 11:15.640
this feeling is the only 
thing I have that's real."

11:19.320 --> 11:22.870
It's all just a bunch of lip service!

11:22.870 --> 11:25.280
If you think love will keep you two together,

11:25.280 --> 11:29.160
see if you can still love her 
when she turns into a fly!

11:29.160 --> 11:31.520
Think you can? You can't, can you?!

11:31.520 --> 11:33.440
Because it's disgusting!

11:33.440 --> 11:36.090
You said that very clearly yourself!

11:40.050 --> 11:44.050
You just look at me, meat scrap!

11:49.020 --> 11:54.840
Ugh, my head hurts. I got all 
excited and lost my composure.

11:55.550 --> 11:57.320
How embarrassing! Tee-hee!

12:01.480 --> 12:04.640
Oh, dear. Looks like you're about to die.

12:04.640 --> 12:05.550
This one, too.

12:05.550 --> 12:07.740
Oh, I know!

12:12.400 --> 12:13.960
What... are you...

12:14.310 --> 12:21.010
I'm gonna find out what sorts of ugly 
meat scraps you guys will turn into!

12:22.260 --> 12:25.220
Does it hurt? Well? Does it hurt?

12:25.540 --> 12:29.470
My blood has dragon blood in it, you know.

12:29.470 --> 12:32.430
If you succumb to its curse, 
the outcome will be wild!

12:33.600 --> 12:37.930
I wonder which one of you 
will hold out longer.

12:50.590 --> 12:52.000
Well, well.

12:52.000 --> 12:54.130
That's not half bad.

13:06.160 --> 13:08.010
Insolent arm-covered freak!

13:09.500 --> 13:11.540
Piece 'o shit, jumpin' into my blind spot!

13:22.540 --> 13:23.810
Boss!

13:26.630 --> 13:27.450
Understood.

13:28.910 --> 13:32.450
Anastasia-sama, I've learned 
something very troubling.

13:32.450 --> 13:33.830
What happened?

13:34.400 --> 13:37.400
No one can get in touch 
with the Council of Ten.

13:37.400 --> 13:40.420
This is, without question, 
the work of the Witch's Cult.

13:41.300 --> 13:43.630
Kiritaka-san, I'm sure ya know, but...

13:45.090 --> 13:47.440
I'm one of their targets, as well.

13:47.440 --> 13:49.920
Anastasia-sama, get ready to evacuate.

13:49.920 --> 13:51.600
And what are you gonna do?

13:52.800 --> 13:55.680
Ya can't just go throwin' your life away.

13:55.680 --> 13:57.310
Whatever happens, you gotta live.

13:59.570 --> 14:01.280
I'm surprised.

14:01.280 --> 14:05.150
I thought you would say 
something more pragmatic.

14:05.630 --> 14:10.400
Surprised to find out I ain't some 
heartless, money-loving monster?

14:10.400 --> 14:15.580
I do business under the motto 
"Your friendly neighborhood shop."

14:18.720 --> 14:21.100
What's going on?! Someone, report!

14:19.600 --> 14:21.790
I'm sorry! Thank you!

14:22.120 --> 14:24.440
Oh, how wonderful!

14:26.470 --> 14:31.430
Helping and trusting one 
another kept you both alive.

14:31.430 --> 14:32.930
Applause!

14:33.730 --> 14:35.770
The Sin Archbishop of Wrath...

14:37.100 --> 14:39.790
Oh, you know who I am?

14:39.790 --> 14:42.320
Now I'm a bit embarrassed.

14:42.320 --> 14:45.780
I hope the things you've heard 
about me weren't all bad.

14:45.780 --> 14:50.110
I am Sirius Romanée-Conti of Wrath.

14:50.900 --> 14:53.070
It's so nice to meet you.

14:53.510 --> 14:54.580
Can you stand?

15:01.570 --> 15:02.860
Anastasia-sama!

15:11.720 --> 15:13.430
Hetaro! Tivey!

15:13.430 --> 15:14.550
Milady!

15:14.550 --> 15:16.110
You all right?

15:16.110 --> 15:18.970
I'm fine! But what about 
Mimi? Don't tell me—

15:18.970 --> 15:20.690
She's not, Anastasia-sama!

15:21.000 --> 15:22.900
I used a forbidden method!

15:22.900 --> 15:25.320
The same thing I did for Subaru-kyun's leg!

15:26.410 --> 15:27.400
Milady!

15:27.400 --> 15:29.380
We gotta keep looking ahead!

15:29.380 --> 15:34.030
Our sister told us to keep you safe, 
no matter how much it hurt us!

15:34.030 --> 15:36.560
What about you? What are you gonna do?

15:37.590 --> 15:38.830
I'll...

15:41.690 --> 15:44.920
I'll buy time! Is two minutes enough?

15:44.920 --> 15:48.070
As our sister would say, 
"Leave it all to us!"

15:48.070 --> 15:50.630
It'll look awesome if 
we make it through this!

15:50.630 --> 15:53.890
Oh, what adorable sibling love!

15:53.890 --> 15:56.050
Are you twins?

15:56.050 --> 15:57.280
Sorry, but...

15:57.280 --> 15:59.520
...we're the little brothers 
in a set of triplets!

15:59.520 --> 16:02.050
Felis-san! Get Mimi and the others out!

16:02.050 --> 16:03.190
I'll meet ya outside!

16:03.190 --> 16:04.230
Got it!

16:07.300 --> 16:08.140
Young master!

16:08.140 --> 16:08.690
Are you all right?!

16:09.630 --> 16:13.300
Leave through there.
My men and I will keep her busy.

16:18.130 --> 16:22.790
Anastasia-sama, I entrust the 
city of Priestella to you.

16:25.750 --> 16:28.600
Protect this beautiful city of water

16:28.600 --> 16:33.260
and our beloved songstress 
from these heinous villains.

16:34.800 --> 16:37.130
That just ain't fair...

16:48.800 --> 16:50.110
Want a drink?

16:50.110 --> 16:53.290
Don't talk to me. You reek of booze.

17:05.460 --> 17:07.900
Ugh, a zodda?

17:16.730 --> 17:18.180
I'm sorry!

17:24.640 --> 17:26.870
So what're you gonna do?

17:26.870 --> 17:29.360
Kill your actual father?

17:30.870 --> 17:31.360
Hey.

17:33.370 --> 17:34.610
Felt-sama...

17:36.510 --> 17:37.990
Forget it. Just tie him up.

17:40.400 --> 17:44.750
Man, I sat in the same position for 
too long. My butt's killing me.

17:46.070 --> 17:48.580
I wasn't entirely sure what 
the situation was in here.

17:49.180 --> 17:51.200
Was that all right?

17:51.200 --> 17:53.210
You're Subaru's...

17:54.670 --> 17:58.720
I get it. Those zodda bugs came from you.

17:58.720 --> 18:00.400
Thank you. You saved us.

18:00.400 --> 18:02.260
No, he didn't!

18:02.260 --> 18:06.990
I would've felt less impending death 
with a sword thrust at my face!

18:06.990 --> 18:08.520
Give me reparations!

18:08.860 --> 18:12.420
I'm pretty sure I just 
saved your life, though...

18:12.420 --> 18:13.180
Hmph!

18:13.860 --> 18:15.670
Why are you here?

18:15.670 --> 18:18.400
I thought you were with Subaru.

18:18.400 --> 18:20.320
It was pure coincidence, actually.

18:21.000 --> 18:24.240
I was just looking for a place to hide.

18:24.790 --> 18:28.210
The Sin Archbishop of Gluttony? 
I'm impressed you're alive.

18:28.210 --> 18:31.280
All thanks to the White Dragon's Scales.

18:31.280 --> 18:34.100
If they hadn't been there, I'd be...

18:35.140 --> 18:36.890
How are Subaru and the others?

18:36.890 --> 18:38.490
I don't know.

18:38.490 --> 18:42.510
Given the kind of guy he is, I'm sure 
he's stubbornly holding his ground.

18:42.510 --> 18:44.260
Hey, loser.

18:44.880 --> 18:47.020
Nothing to worry about here anymore, right?

18:47.020 --> 18:49.350
So get out there and help him!

18:49.710 --> 18:51.880
No, I will stay—

18:51.110 --> 18:54.520
You think you're gonna save me 
after the hell I just went through?

18:55.600 --> 18:59.280
I'll take this guy and head 
to the nearest shelter.

18:59.280 --> 19:03.000
So you get out there and wrap 
all this nonsense right up!

19:04.300 --> 19:05.500
Reinhard!

19:06.300 --> 19:07.220
Understood.

19:07.890 --> 19:09.960
Please try not to be reckless.

19:09.960 --> 19:12.410
And you'd better be reckless!

19:12.410 --> 19:14.170
Show 'em what you can do!

19:19.840 --> 19:22.840
So... what do we do now, huh?

19:22.840 --> 19:24.830
I don't think I can carry you on my back.

19:24.830 --> 19:27.900
Why do I gotta do errand boy work?

19:27.900 --> 19:29.460
What choice did we have?

19:29.460 --> 19:32.310
The shelter's about to run out of food.

19:35.020 --> 19:36.730
I think this is the first time

19:36.730 --> 19:40.200
you guys ever showed up at 
exactly the right moment!

19:42.660 --> 19:43.740
What now?!

19:44.230 --> 19:45.830
When did they...

19:47.790 --> 19:49.670
Whoa, whoa! That ain't funny!

19:49.670 --> 19:50.710
To high ground!

20:05.540 --> 20:06.640
Garfiel-dono!

20:08.330 --> 20:11.230
Damn it! What the hell's goin' on?!

20:27.280 --> 20:28.330
Boss?!

20:33.470 --> 20:34.620
Wait!

20:51.340 --> 20:53.750
Boss!

20:52.930 --> 20:56.940
<b>A Dark Torrent</b>

22:31.950 --> 22:35.160
No... The city...

22:35.880 --> 22:37.640
You mustn't make that face.

22:37.640 --> 22:39.380
Our dear husband won't like it.

22:39.380 --> 22:41.380
What are you talking about?! 
This isn't the time for—

22:41.380 --> 22:44.540
<i>Ah, ah! Hello, meat scraps!</i>

22:44.540 --> 22:45.170
What's that?

22:44.540 --> 22:48.510
<i>Still happily holed up and 
shaking in your shoes?</i>

22:48.510 --> 22:53.640
<i>You're hearing the beautiful voice of the 
Sin Archbishop of Lust, Capella-chan-sama!</i>

22:54.990 --> 22:57.600
<i>So, even after all I said to them,</i>

22:57.600 --> 23:02.370
<i>a whole bunch of meat scraps 
still busted in here after me!</i>

23:02.370 --> 23:04.420
<i>They wounded me,</i>

23:04.420 --> 23:11.060
<i>so now I have three more demands 
in addition to the witch's remains!</i>

23:11.060 --> 23:16.630
<i>First, bring me the Tome of Wisdom 
that's been brought into this city.</i>

23:16.630 --> 23:22.370
<i>Second, bring me the artificial spirit 
that's been chilling in this city.</i>

23:22.370 --> 23:23.750
<i>And finally...</i>

23:24.080 --> 23:28.710
<i>The wedding with the silver-haired 
girl that's to be held in this city!</i>

23:29.090 --> 23:32.160
I guess the point is:
Don't go trying to interfere.

23:32.160 --> 23:34.680
Like I care but...
